==English==

===Etymology===
{{suffix|jingo|ism|lang=en}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈdʒɪŋɡɘʊɪz(ɘ)m/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{context|uncountable|lang=en}} Excessive [[patriotism]] or [[aggressive]] [[nationalism]] especially with regards to foreign policy.
# {{context|countable|lang=en}} A jingoistic attitude, comment, etc.

